OL,3,GNEWSAMan changes name to 'Mr Dorking
OL,4,AWanderers'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has described how he woke up one
OL,7,Fday and spontaneously decided to change
OL,8,Fhis name to honour his favourite
OL,9,Ffootball team.
OL,11,FKeith Thripp told the BBC he has now
OL,12,Fbecome "Mr Keith Dorking Wanderers FC
OL,13,FThripp" after falling in love with the
OL,14,FSurrey side.
OL,16,FBut the superfan said he is not even
OL,17,Ffrom the local area - and instead lives
OL,18,Fin Portsmouth.
OL,20,F"I have to drive hours to watch the
OL,21,Fhome games," he told the BBC.
